e decided + no value; no rule matched + proposed value; no rule matched + no value (pure escalate) |\n| `lib/uuid.ts` | `isUuid` | valid v4, uppercase hex, wrong segment lengths, missing hyphens, trailing whitespace |\n| `lib/validate-value.ts` | `foldValue`, `checkObservedValue`, `observedValues` | multiple stacked suffixes (`\"Trellis Labs Pvt Ltd\"`), value *equal to* a suffix (`\"Ltd\"` alone), punctuation-only diffs, both sides empty, candidate matches via folding not exact match |\n| `lib/audit-detail.ts` | `auditDetailParts`, `auditDetailLine`, `auditNote` | every optional detail key present/absent in combination; `from === to` (no arrow); `count` with unmapped `AuditAction` (no noun); `previousStatus` underscore→hyphen |\n| `lib/api-client.ts` | `postJson`, `patchJson` | `fetch` throws (offline); non-OK with `error` field; non-OK with no body; response body not valid JSON |\n| `lib/cn.ts` | `cn` | conflicting Tailwind classes actually merge (not just concatenate) |\n\n**Skeleton — `lib/validate-value.test.ts`** (most logic-dense file, worth the fullest example):\n\n```ts\nimport { describe, it, expect } from \"vitest\";\nimport { foldValue, checkObservedValue, observedValues, LEGAL_SUFFIXES } from \"@/lib/validate-value\";\n\ndescribe(\"foldValue\", () => {\n  it(\"lowercases, strips punctuation, collapses whitespace\", () => {\n    expect(foldValue(\"ACME-INC\")).toBe(\"acme\");\n    expect(foldValue(\"ACME INC\")).toBe(\"acme\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"strips a legal suffix\", () => {\n    expect(foldValue(\"Trellis Labs Inc\")).toBe(\"trellis labs\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"strips stacked suffixes longest-first (pvt ltd, not ltd alone)\", () => {\n    expect(foldValue(\"Trellis Labs Pvt Ltd\")).toBe(\"trellis labs\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"does not strip when the whole value IS the suffix\", () => {\n    expect(foldValue(\"Ltd\")).toBe(\"ltd\");\n  });\n\n  it(\"handles empty and whitespace-only input\", () => {\n    expect(foldValue(\"   \")).toBe(\"\");\n  });\n});\n\nd